<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Vendex cut at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Vendex cut at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch retailer Vendex International NV was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was down 3.80 guilders at 101.80 guilders by 1047 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
